    "semantic_summary": "VectorInspector is a specialized Angular component designed to provide a UI for inspecting and modifying vector data (Vector4, Vector3, Vector2) within the editor. It manages interaction through two primary modes: direct text input modification and visual gizmo manipulation. It consumes vector data via @Input() and emits changes via the @Output() vectorChanged event, ensuring data integrity through sanitization before state updates."
